    },
    {
      "end": 6516.76,
      "start": 6512.76,
      "text": "And the election and regarding to voters fraud?"
    },
    {
      "end": 6523.76,
      "start": 6516.76,
      "text": "Right I do believe that he is lost on the..."
    },
    {
      "end": 6531.76,
      "start": 6523.76,
      "text": "For the electoral votes and I believe that he has the power to make it happen"
    },
    {
      "end": 6534.76,
      "start": 6531.76,
