      "end": 6536.76,
      "start": 6534.76,
      "text": "Right"
    },
    {
      "end": 6539.76,
      "start": 6536.76,
      "text": "What about COVID-19"
    },
    {
      "end": 6547.76,
      "start": 6539.76,
      "text": "Are you aware that COVID-19 is actually manufactured and released intentionally by the CCP"
    },
